MAIN
MOVE TEMP 19 8
MOVE TEMP 20 HALLOCATE TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 12
MOVE TEMP 22 HALLOCATE TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 A_sub
HSTORE TEMP 5 4 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 B_multi
HSTORE TEMP 5 8 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 A_add
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 0
MOVE TEMP 27 TEMP 26
HSTORE TEMP 4 4 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 8
MOVE TEMP 29 5
MOVE TEMP 30 10
MOVE TEMP 31 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 3 TEMP 29 TEMP 30 )
PRINT TEMP 31
END
A_add [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 32 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 33 TEMP 32
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 33
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 8
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 9
END
A_sub [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 34 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 35 TEMP 34
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 35
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 10
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 11
END
B_multi [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 36 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 37 TEMP 36
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 37
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 0
MOVE TEMP 38 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 13 TEMP 1 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 39 TEMP 38
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 0
HLOAD TEMP 18 TEMP 17 4
MOVE TEMP 40 CALL TEMP 18 ( TEMP 16 TEMP 1 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 41 TEMP 40
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 42 1

RETURN TEMP 42
END

